# Corpus full text. Hundreds of MB of PMC OA JATS XML, regenerable from
# corpus/manifest.csv + corpus/run_info.json + ingestion/pull_corpus.py.
# manifest.csv carries a per-file sha256, so any re-fetch is byte-verifiable
# without the blobs living in git. corpus/manifest.csv and corpus/run_info.json
# are NOT ignored: they are the reproducibility record and must be committed.
corpus/xml/
ingestion/corpus/xml/

